# wvkbd deskintl layout, redesigned for Ky after the folio: standard staggered QWERTY.
#- no F-key row (top row = numbers, Esc at its left); Fn flips to a layer that is the
#   same keyboard with F1-F12 on the number row, ` at top left, Del, and
#   Home/PgUp/PgDn/End on the arrows;
#- Caps left of A, no Cmp (compose still works by pressing a letter and sliding),
#   Ctrl, Fn, Super, Alt on the left of the bottom row, no right Alt/Ctrl/Shift;
#- the touch_app glyph (KEY_F13, niri-bound, pad mode) sits where right Shift
#   would; every row sums to the source layout width, 14.5 units.
#- beside space: autocorrect (KEY_F14) and swipe (KEY_F15), both niri-bound.
